WEBVTT

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.297
I get to work in one of the most
incredible wetland systems on Earth.

00:01:33.714 --> 00:01:38.261
The sources of the Kavango
Zambezi Transfrontier Conservation area,

00:01:38.302 --> 00:01:39.929
KAZA for short.

00:01:39.971 --> 00:01:43.099
But now KAZA spreads
through five countries

00:01:43.141 --> 00:01:46.477
and is home to iconic African wildlife,

00:01:46.519 --> 00:01:49.438
incredible landscapes,
like the Okavango Delta,

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:53.025
and up to 2.5 million people.

00:01:53.526 --> 00:01:57.572
Its sources in eastern Angola
are the heart, the lungs

00:01:57.613 --> 00:02:00.658
and the backbone of the entire KAZA,